---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="opportunities">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Ways to contribute</span><h1>Find a role in the society.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">The listings below describe unpaid society work. Separate links point to official internship and research resources.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="join">Join the society</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="resources">Career and research resources</a></div></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/tool-pegboard.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="A pegboard with empty pegs waiting to be filled"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>Before applying elsewhere</strong><p>Verify the deadline, eligibility, location, work authorization, compensation, and application instructions on the official listing.</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Current society openings</span><h2>Open society roles.</h2></div><p>These are unpaid student-organization roles, not internships or employment.</p></div>
    <div class="filters" data-filter-group data-filter-target="#opportunity-grid"><button class="filter-button active" type="button" data-filter="all">All</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="leadership">Leadership</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="project">Projects</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="volunteer">Volunteer</button></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2" id="opportunity-grid" data-opportunity-grid aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state"><h3>Loading opportunities…</h3><p>Fetching current openings.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">External searches</span><h2>Search current official listings.</h2></div><p>Open the original listing and verify its deadline, eligibility, location, compensation, and application instructions.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="resource-card__source">Oberlin College</span><h3>Career Exploration and Development</h3><p>Use Oberlin’s career advising, internship resources, employer connections, and application support.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.oberlin.edu/career" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open CED ↗</a></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="resource-card__source">Oberlin College</span><h3>Undergraduate research</h3><p>Ask faculty, departments, and relevant campus programs about current research roles and funding.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.oberlin.edu/undergraduate-research" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore research ↗</a></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="resource-card__source">United States</span><h3>National Science Foundation REU</h3><p>Search official Research Experiences for Undergraduates sites and confirm citizenship or eligibility rules for each program.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.nsf.gov/crssprgm/reu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Search NSF REU sites ↗</a></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
